flowchart TD
  Panel[MaterialsPanel on subject workspace] --> LocalList[User files links and notes]
  LocalList --> CRUD[Add edit archive delete restore]
  CRUD --> Cloud[(Supabase documents + private Storage\nIMPLEMENTED)]
  Panel --> BackendList[Indexed user materials]
  BackendList -.-> GET["GET /api/subjects/{id}/materials\nPLANNED"]
  Upload[Choose PDF DOCX or image\nIMPLEMENTED] --> Cloud
  Cloud --> Import[POST /api/context/documents/storage\nBEARER AUTH]
  Import --> Parse[Temporary local parse and normalize]
  Parse --> Chunk[Local chunk + embed + index]
  Chunk --> Store[(Supabase user-scoped chunks)]
  Store --> BackendList
  Import --> Status[Indexed status]
  Import --> Review[Parse failure stays Needs review]
  Text[POST /api/context/documents/text\nIMPLEMENTED BACKEND] --> Chunk
  Transcript[TranscriptImportDialog\nsimulated OCR review confirm] --> Assessments[Supabase assessments after review]
